        "full_width": true,
        "code": "<style>\n  .milano-referral-section {\n    font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;\n    background: #F4F4F0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    max-width: 100%;\n    margin: 60px auto;\nmax-height: 60%;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-wrapper {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-content {\n    padding: 40px 60px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-inner {\n    max-width: 520px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-subtitle {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #5C5F6A;\n    margin-bottom: 18px;\n    letter-spacing: 0.4px;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-title {\n    font-size: 42px;\n    line-height: 1.05;\n    font-weight: 500;\n    color: #091350;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n    letter-spacing: -1px;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-description {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    color: #5C5F6A;\n    margin-bottom: 36px;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-highlight {\n    color: #091350;\n    font-weight: 600;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-note {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #7B7E87;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-image {\n    position: relative;\n    height: 650px;\n  }\n\n  .milano-referral-image img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 1024px) {\n\n    .milano-referral-wrapper {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .milano-referral-image {\n      min-height: 420px;\n    }\n\n    .milano-referral-content {\n      padding: 60px 30px;\n    }\n\n    .milano-referral-title {\n      font-size: 42px;\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {\n\n    .milano-referral-title {\n      font-size: 36px;\n    }\n\n    .milano-referral-description {\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"milano-referral-section\">\n\n  <div class=\"milano-referral-wrapper\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT CONTENT -->\n    <div class=\"milano-referral-content\">\n\n      <div class=\"milano-referral-inner\">\n\n        <div class=\"milano-referral-subtitle\">\n          Refer a Friend\n        </div>\n\n        <h2 class=\"milano-referral-title\">\n          GIVE $100,<br>\n          GET $100\n        </h2>\n\n        <div class=\"milano-referral-description\">\n          Invite your friends to discover Milano Jewelry and enjoy exclusive rewards together.\n          Your friend receives <span class=\"milano-referral-highlight\">$100 OFF</span> their first purchase, and you receive <span class=\"milano-referral-highlight\">$100 OFF</span> once they complete their order.\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"milano-referral-note\">\n          Share timeless luxury with the people you love.\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT IMAGE -->\n    <div class=\"milano-referral-image\">\n\n      <img \n        src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0367/6287/8085/files/Mothers_day_mobile_banner.png?v=1776101467\"\n        alt=\"Milano Jewelry Referral Program\"\n      >\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n</div>"
      }
